{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34782","headline":"自诫 · 司空图","name":"自诫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我祖铭座右，嘉谋贻厥孙。\n勤此苟不怠，令名日可存。\n媒衒士所耻，慈俭道所尊。\n松柏岂不茂，桃李亦自繁。\n衆人皆察察，而我独昏昏。\n取训於老氏，大辩欲讷言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}